# ShowCrafter Design System (cheatsheet)

Full doc lives at [.claude/skills/showcrafter-design-system/SKILL.md](mdc:.claude/skills/showcrafter-design-system/SKILL.md).
Tokens live in [platform/app/globals.css](mdc:platform/app/globals.css).

## Colour

- Default dark canvas: `#05070D`; surfaces: `#0B1020`, `#11182A`, `#141B2E`.
- Text: `#F5F7FA`, secondary `#AAB6C8`, muted `#65748B`.
- Accents: neon cyan `#00E5FF`, electric blue `#3B82F6`, violet `#8B5CF6`,
  magenta `#FF3DF2`.
- Status: live/success `#00FF9C`, danger `#FF4D6D`.
- Yellow `#FFD166` is only for finale/highlight/wow states.
- Light mode uses cool blue/violet tokens, not parchment or brown.

## Typography

- Geist Sans for UI/display via `next/font`.
- Geist Mono for timestamps, product codes, prices, quantities, AI confidence,
  and table metadata.
- Use tabular numerals on numbers.

## Components

- CTAs: rounded-full, 44px+ touch target, `shadow-[var(--shadow-cta)]`.
- Cards/panels: `rounded-xl`, token border, glassy token surface, no nested card
  stacks unless the inner item is repeated data.
- Inputs/selects: token border, visible focus ring, labels or `aria-label`.
- Tables: semantic table markup, sticky headers where useful, search/filter UI.
- Firework previews: fixed camera in list cards, interactive camera on detail and
  editor pages.

## Forbidden

- No warm brown, burnt orange, parchment, or ember-led brand palette.
- No neon used for long body text.
- No colour-only status.
- No hard-coded colours except WebGL/SVG simulation internals.
- No Material Symbols.
